{"resourceIdentifier":"4168","resourceName":"BAITANG AONONG SWINE FARM COMPOSTING PROJECT","description":"Baitang Aonong Swine Farm Composting Project (hereinafter referred to as the Project) is located at Baitang Village, Xinzhou Town, Huangping County, Qiandongnan Miao and Dong Autonomous Prefecture, Guizhou Province, P.R. China. The project is owned and implemented by Guizhou Aonong Qihuan Animal Husbandry Co., Ltd.\r\nThe project will introduce new anaerobic animal manure management system (Anaerobic Digester) to treat manure of from Baitang Aonong Swine Breeding Farm. The project uses digester to treat animal manure, collect the generated biogas to avoid methane emissions. The generated biogas will be captured and flared within the project site. The residual waste from the digester will be used for agriculture fertilization aerobically in the nearby farmland. Wastewater from the animal manure treatment system will be used for irrigation and no wastewater will be discharged to the environment. Construction of the project started on 20-Feb-2020 and the project is started operation on 01-Aug-2021.\r\nPrior to the implementation of the project, the manure was left to decay in open anaerobic lagoon at the project site and generated methane is emitted to the atmosphere directly without any methane recovery and destruction facility.\r\nThe project is expected to avoid GHG emission of methane from the uncovered open lagoon. The project is expected to achieve annual GHG emissions reduction of 28,075 tCO2e and a total emission reduction of 280,750 tCO2e during the 10-year crediting period.","location":{"latitude":26.893062,"longitude":107.909095},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2023-02-24","endExclusive":"2023-03-27","endInclusive":"2023-03-26"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"4168"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guizhou Province"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guizhou Aonong Qihuan Animal Husbandry Co., Ltd"},{"type":"string","value":"Guizhou Province, China"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"59776"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Waste handling and disposal"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"AMS-III.F."}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"05/02/2024"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 01/08/2021 - 31/07/2031"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Pipeline Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=85254&IDKEY=9iofj09234rm9oq4jndsma80vcalksdjf98cxkjaf90823nmq38117565266","documentType":"Draft Project Description","documentName":"VCS_PROJ_DESC_PCP_4168_01FEB2023.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-02-24T16:55:54.57Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=84458&IDKEY=d097809fdslkjf09rndasfufd098asodfjlkduf09nm23mrn87d116467582","documentType":"Listing Representation","documentName":"Baitang lisiting01.pdf","uploadDate":"2023-02-10T05:03:59.35Z"}]},{"code":"VCS_REGISTRATION_DOCUMENTS","description":"VCS Registration Documents","documents":[{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=107093&IDKEY=klksjoiuwqowrnoiuomnckjashoufifmln902309ksdflku098f147681247","documentType":"Project Description","documentName":"VCS-Project Description-VCS4168-clean.pdf","uploadDate":"2024-02-05T20:02:12.607Z"},{"uri":"https://registry.verra.org/mymodule/ProjectDoc/Project_ViewFile.asp?FileID=94477&IDKEY=dq934lkmsad39asj